    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστο-πολῑτευτής</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεύω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>best of citizens,</i>
			honorary title, esp. at Sparta, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).335
			</span></i>, al.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστο-πολίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ,</span>
			<i>best citizen,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώνιος ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				468
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				2.29
			</span></i> (Panticapaeum; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πυλίτης</span>
			lapis):— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστο-πολῑτεία</span></b> , ἡ,
				<i>privileges of an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).65
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sparta</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				893
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Messene</span>).</div>
